10. Ending

Your rights under this licence end automatically if you break it. Bright Coast AI may also end them by telling you in writing. When they end, stop using the Materials and delete your copies.

11. Permission and questions

To ask for permission to do something this licence does not allow, or to ask anything about it, write to support@brightcoast.ai.

